   "title": "FOUR or more joints: inflammatory or degenerative, acute or chronic, and in what PATTERN?",
   "lines": [
    "inflamed synovium (synovitis) = swelling, warmth, pain, stiffness · redness only with infection or crystals",
    "every inflammatory arthritis is a CLINICAL diagnosis: history, extra-articular clues, then targeted tests"
   ]
  },
  {
